The package umicp provides CMake targets:

    find_package(UMICP CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE UMICP::UMICP)

Features:
  - websocket: Enable WebSocket transport (default: ON)
  - http: Enable HTTP transport (default: ON)
  - tests: Build tests (default: OFF)

Example usage:

    #include <umicp/envelope.hpp>
    
    umicp::Envelope envelope;
    envelope.setFrom("sender");
    envelope.setTo("receiver");
    envelope.setOperation(umicp::OperationType::DATA);
    
For more information, see: https://github.com/hivellm/umicp

